OL,3,GNEWSAJoey Barton to remain in custody
OL,4,Aahead of 2027 trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer footballer Joey Barton will
OL,7,Fremain in custody until his trial next
OL,8,Fyear after a bail application was
OL,9,Frefused.
OL,11,FThe 44-year-old, from Widnes, Cheshire,
OL,12,Fdenies causing grievous bodily harm
OL,13,Fwith intent to Kevin Lynch, 51, at
OL,14,FFairway, Huyton, on 8 March.
OL,16,FLast week at Liverpool Crown Court
OL,17,FJudge David Potter adjourned the trial
OL,18,Fto 8 March, 2027 - and Barton can now
OL,19,Fnot be released in the meantime.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
